<title>USA: Asia Pacific at 4-3/4 in New York.</title>
<headline>Asia Pacific at 4-3/4 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pacific Resources International Holdings Ltd (April) closed at 4-3/4 in New York on Wednesday. It recorded the day's high of 4-7/8 and the day's low of 4-3/4.</p>
<p>Volume was 13,700 shares. Block volume was 13,500. Its previous close on Tuesday was 4-3/4.</p>
<p>April listed 20 million shares of Class A common stock in New York -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
